    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Siege Regiment",
    "summary": "As each [battle round](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-battle-round) begins, pick a type of artillery support from this list:\n\n- **Creeping Barrage**: roll a D6 per enemy unit over 12\" away from all of your models on the battlefield. Each unit that rolls a 5+ is shaken for the rest of the battle round. A shaken unit gets -2\" M and -2 to its [Charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step).\n- **Incendiary Bombardment**: pick enemy units over 12\" away from all of your models on the battlefield. They are scattered for the rest of the battle round, and a scattered unit cannot get the [Benefit of Cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover).\n- **Smoke Shells**: pick units of yours. They get [Stealth](vsdata:core-ability/stealth) for the rest of the battle round.\n\nHow many units a type can shake, scatter or pick depends on [battle size](vsdata:core-rule/select-battle-size): up to 2 in Incursion, 3 in Strike Force or 4 in Onslaught.",
